// Local, per-machine build settings for the SpaceNotes Live demo.
//
// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig (which is gitignored) and put your Apple
// Team ID below. With a free Apple ID it is shown in Xcode > Settings >
// Accounts > your Apple ID > "Personal Team"; select the team there once, then
// copy its ten-character ID, or pick the team in the target's Signing &
// Capabilities tab and read it back from Build Settings > Development Team.
//
// Set it here rather than in Xcode's UI: the .xcodeproj is generated, and
// `xcodegen generate` throws away anything set through the UI, while this
// file survives. A Team ID is not a secret, but it is yours, so keep it out
// of git.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
